c/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:381:        :repair-ticks (limit :repair-ticks)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:400:             assoc :reader reader :cursor nil :due nil))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:487:                      :delay (:repair-ticks follower)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:488:                      :due nil\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:573:                                                 :due (if more?\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:579:                                                :due nil))))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:632:                    :due (+ now (:delay cand))))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:694:      (< now (:due candidate)) [follower node []]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker/head.cljc:700:                    :due nil\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:1203:  \"What a `yin.link` call is answered under (yin.repl.query/serve): the\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:1229:   query interpreter (`yin.repl.query/serve`) answers from the session's\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:1258:                       (link/serve {:pair (:link-pair state)\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl.cljc:1265:                         (query/serve {:pair (:query-pair state)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
